                <invention-title lang="de">AUF KÜNSTLICHER INTELLIGENZ BASIERENDES SYSTEM UND VERFAHREN ZUR ERZEUGUNG DYNAMISCH VARIABLER MEHRDIMENSIONALER DATENSCHUTZBEWERTUNG FÜR FAHRZEUGE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈME ET PROCÉDÉ BASÉS SUR L'INTELLIGENCE ARTIFICIELLE POUR GÉNÉRER UN INDICE DE CONFIDENTIALITÉ MULTIDIMENSIONNEL DYNAMIQUEMENT VARIABLE POUR VÉHICULES</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE BASED SYSTEM AND METHOD FOR GENERATING DYNAMICALLY VARIABLE MULTI-DIMENSIONAL PRIVACY RATING FOR VEHICLES</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Generating, using artificial intelligence algorithms and a training dataset, at least one machine learning model that is configured to generate scores for multiple attributes of one or more personal data handling approaches associated with a vehicle and/or an in-vehicle unit of the vehicle that handles personal data of a user. The training dataset comprises labelled documents that define the personal data handling approaches, each labelled document having scores pre-assigned to one or more of the multiple attributes of the respective personal data handling approach. Determining one or more personal data handling approaches associated with a target vehicle linked to received vehicle identification information and at least one in-vehicle unit of the target vehicle that handles personal data of the user. Performing semantical analysis of the personal data handling approaches. Generating scores using the machine learning model and the personal data handling approaches that have been semantically analyzed.</p>
            </abstract>
